<h2>Product Vision: AI Organized Around My Work</h2>

<p>An AI teammate should:</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Understand me:</strong> role, ownership, priorities, and working context</li>
<li><strong>Understand my work:</strong> tasks, business objects, deadlines, and dependencies</li>
<li><strong>Watch for what matters:</strong> continuously monitor relevant business activity</li>
<li><strong>Recommend the next move:</strong> explain what happened, why it matters, and what to do next</li>
<li><strong>Help execute:</strong> prepare communication, actions, and follow-ups</li>
<li><strong>Learn from feedback:</strong> improve through explicit feedback and observed outcomes</li>
</ul>

<p>Defining principle</p>
<p><strong>The difference between a chatbot and a teammate is not conversation. It is the ability to take responsibility for work within clear boundaries.</strong></p>
</section>

