<h2>Key Trade-offs</h2>

<p><strong>Breadth vs. depth</strong><br>
Start with one workflow instead of building a generic assistant.</p>

<p><strong>Automation vs. trust</strong><br>
Start with human approval and expand autonomy only after validation.</p>

<p><strong>Generality vs. data quality</strong><br>
Use a limited set of high-quality data domains before expanding coverage.</p>

<p><strong>Short-term efficiency vs. long-term platform value</strong><br>
Use a narrow MVP to validate reusable platform primitives.</p>

<p><strong>Speed vs. governance</strong><br>
Move quickly inside controlled boundaries rather than treating governance as a later phase.</p>
</section>

